  "bodyHash": "5PslffPE3gg=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5;font-size:28px\">音樂通知</span></p><p>在遊戲中播放音樂時，新增一個顯示曲名、作者和專輯名稱的彈窗通知。</p><h3><strong>需求</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>📷 遊戲內截圖</h1><div>\n<table style=\"width:85.0344%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast_album.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">顯示專輯名稱：開啟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/toasts.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"344\" height=\"252\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">不同的彈窗配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/1.21.8/img/modded1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">支援模組內容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-mc-music-discs\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多音樂唱片</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/.github/assets/jukebox_home_tab.webp\" alt=\"Jukebox menu\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/img/jukebox.png\" alt=\"\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">透過點唱機選單隨時隨地播放任何音樂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>🎀 通知樣式</h1><div>\n<table style=\"width:85.0344%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast.webp\" alt=\"點唱機選單\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/img/jukebox.png\" alt=\"\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">一般彈窗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/action_bar.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">動作欄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/compact.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">精簡模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><h1>⚙ 設定</h1><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/config.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h1>影片預覽</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fHK2swFtPanA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/HK2swFtPanA</a></p><h1>自訂化</h1><blockquote>\n<p>若要支援自訂音樂或自訂現有曲目，你需要在自訂資源包的 musicnotification 命名空間下新增一個名為 musics.json 的檔案。</p>\n</blockquote><p>JSON 架構可在這裡找到：<a href=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/blob/next-stonecutter/DOCS.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DOCS.md</a><br>如有任何問題，歡迎提交問題回報。</p><h1>貢獻者</h1><p>唱片圖示由 <a href=\"https://github.com/carotteatomique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">carotteatomique</a> 製作<br>模組圖示由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdribbble.com%252fakairoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">akairoo</a> 製作<br>簡體中文翻譯由 <a href=\"https://github.com/Chiloven945\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chiloven945</a> 提供</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
